{
  "name": "AKU faculty secures prestigious scholarship",
  "parent_id": 203313787796667,
  "group_id": "dabeb7c5-3f5b-40b1-913f-739c1ac1d2d3",
  "alternates": [],
  "created_at": "2026-07-30T14:49:58.217Z",
  "deleted_at": null,
  "sort_by_date": null,
  "tag_list": [],
  "updated_at": "2026-08-12T15:13:08.264Z",
  "published_at": "2026-08-12T15:13:08.250Z",
  "id": 203707999137426,
  "uuid": "eab908ff-6d75-4c8e-ac1c-d6d2b63ab1e2",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "833e4135-1a91-d6bf-c3a0-2ef241c0d93b",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "ac9fd485-6e0e-1e69-342c-079f1add7f82",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The scholarship supports a select number of clinicians, researchers or investors residing outside the U.S.A. with a confirmed interest in the advancement of paediatric innovation.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Dr Aslam, assistant professor and paediatric cardiologist in the Department of Paediatrics and Child Health, will be one of the delegates representing Asia at the Summit.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"On an almost daily basis, our resource limited setting provides a strong stimulus to innovate, to customize, to invent, to think out-of-the-box and to do things that are sometimes 'crazy' to help those who need it the most,\" says Dr Aslam. \"This is what I feel, leads to innovation and to making this world a better place to live in.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "At this year's Summit, Dr Aslam will have the opportunity to interact with the \"intelligent minds of the world\" and thought-provoking leaders, to ignite advances and accelerate solutions in paediatric health care, from the moment an idea is conceived to its entrance in the health care.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"I am looking for long-term collaboration between the Boston Children's Hospital and the Aga Khan University,\" Dr Aslam emphasised, \"a partnership that can spark change in the way we treat our child patients.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
